opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "A self-hosting-oriented compiler for the Cronyx language"
description:
  "The second bootstrap compiler for Cronyx: scanner, parser, type checker, metaprogramming, effect handlers via a selective CPS transform, and a tree-walking interpreter."
maintainer: ["Brendan Cron <brendancron@gmail.com>"]
authors: ["Brendan Cron <brendancron@gmail.com>"]
tags: ["compiler" "language" "metaprogramming" "algebraic effects"]
